These metrics capture a diverse range of aspects, such as code size (loc, lOCode), logical complexity (v(g), branchCount), cognitive effort (d, e), and the structural relationships between operators and operands (uniq_Op, uniq_Opnd), making them highly relevant to predict software defects.

